# Law Filter

Before citing law ask:

Can this email achieve its objective without legal references?

If YES:

Do not cite law.

---

# Use Law Only When

- establishing a right
- establishing an obligation
- responding to legal claims
- preparing escalation

---

# Default

Do not cite articles.

Do not cite clauses.

Do not explain law.

---

# Principle

Write legally correct.

Not legally crowded.

One legal basis is stronger than five weak ones.
